{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/80twd3g35l",
  "title": "【2025.6.11案例拆解】ETmall  如何提升Adsense的通过率",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "哥飞案例拆解"
  ],
  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这些大模型公司你追我赶，大家齐头并进，对我们用户来说，是有好处的。 我们会有越来越强大，也越来越便宜的模型使用。</div>\n<div>去给大家学知识，学完了再分享给大家</div>\n<div>应该没有吧</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>很有意思，谷歌也用了“半壁江山”来形容Web。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>ETmall 一个电商购物网站，也放Adsense，在卖货收入之外，还获取到了广告收入。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>搜索不仅仅存在于搜索框中，我们还可以引导用户去更多的搜索。 这是在推荐AFS。</div>\n<div>关于如何提升Adsense的通过率，我的总结就是【让你做的网站像网站】</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>总结起来，谷歌喜欢三好生，喜欢你流量来源干净，喜欢你真的为用户提供好的内容，好的体验，而不是随便做个网页就来“变现”。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img9.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img10.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img11.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img12.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>谷歌也引用Similarweb数据</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img13.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img14.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img15.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img16.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img17.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img18.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img19.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>市场潜力来自于CPC和搜索量级的乘积</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img20.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img21.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>车险，车险报价等</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img22.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img23.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img24.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>减肥类网站，不仅仅靠广告变现，更多还是订阅模式，可以赚更多钱。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img25.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img26.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>求职类需求，其实也有大量的工具类需求。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img27.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img28.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img29.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img30.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>补充一下，找手机服务，其实背后是捉奸等找人需求，所以特别赚钱。</div>\n<div>特别说明，这里的补充是哥飞补充的，不是谷歌的人说的。</div>\n<div>总结一下，就是我们群里大家正在做的，蹭热点不要停。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img31.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>帮彪哥说下，这不是排行榜，这是各行各业不同类型网站的典型代表，Hix.ai代表以订阅为主的AI工具站。</div>\n<div>哈哈哈，不赚钱的在上海是吧</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img32.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>宜选科技胡总说，他们公司成立前三年收入来自于Adsense，支撑到了团队到了百人规模。</div>\n<div>Adsense 虽然是变现，但为什么一开场就先聊内容呢？ 因为内容是我们变现的载体，你有好的内容，才能留住优质的流量，最后才是流量变现。</div>\n<div>早期流量全部来自于SEO，但是会有瓶颈，想要上升一个台阶，就得开始买量。 现在网页买量成本越来越高。但是发现从App里买量，价格比较便宜，不过后者流量要注意识别虚假流量。</div>\n<div>NetShort 的Yu Luo 说，OfferWall提升了他们的用户流量价值。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img33.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>谷歌官方认证，新词玩法是可行的。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img34.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>谷歌官方帮助中心，建议大家多去看看</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img35.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>谷歌官方推荐大家去看谷歌质量评估员指南。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img36.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这张图，清晰的告诉我们，一个关键词一个页面玩法，也是谷歌官方建议的。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img37.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>多语言，用不同url来区分，而不是js切换。 不过谷歌这里举例用子域名实现多语言，哥飞建议还是用子目录实现多语言。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img38.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这种说法是错误的。 谷歌根据页面内容来判断语言，而不是你标签指定的。</div>\n<div>所以一个页面，只能写一种语言，尽量不要包含多个语言的内容。</div>\n<div>hreflang 标签的用途是告诉谷歌爬虫，同一个内容的不同语言对应页面的关联关系。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img39.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>确保内容质量的前提下，随便你用哪种翻译方式，或者说内容生成方式。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img40.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img41.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>谷歌官方推荐大家合理利用谷歌趋势发现新趋势。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img42.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>CNET 为图片添加合理的alt后，流量增加了30%</div>\n<div>公开没说</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img43.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>今天反复提到，Web依然还是半壁江山，并且在高速增长。</div>\n<div>特别是研究、学习等工具使用场景，更是更多在web端进行。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img44.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>如果将优化用户体验视作一种投资的话，这会是ROI很高的一种投资行为。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img45.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/80twd3g35l_img46.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>体量如新东方，也需要半年转型探索。 我们群里很多朋友刚入行做出海Web，更应该多一点耐心。</div>",
